      "content": "it's hard to see a \"transition\" when everything feels so finished. i look at my hands and they don't even feel like mine anymore. i just feel like a burden to everyone, if i even have anyone left. sometimes i think... wouldn't it just be more dignified to just decide when it's time to go, instead of waiting for something to break? it feels like the only thing i have left is the choice of how it ends.",
